## A Claude subscription dashboard turns local session files into account-level observability

Source: Prakhar Gurunani — https://prakhargurunani.com/blog/building-claude-observability/
Published: 2026-10-12
Channel: hn

Gurunani describes a collector and dashboard that combine Claude Code usage across machines. The article focuses on deduplicated ingestion, missing-machine detection, local data minimization, and the limits of telemetry extracted from undocumented session files. Its cost comparisons are API-equivalent usage estimates, not a subscription invoice.

Why it matters: Useful agent analytics need coverage checks and privacy controls alongside usage totals. Treat this as a practitioner implementation, not an official Anthropic reporting API.

